PROMISES

Promise = work still running.
- await
- promise-all
- promise-all-settled
- promise-any
- promise-race
- promise-state
- promises
- cancel

A PROMISE IS A LIVE VALUE. An unawaited load is done: carry on. Await only to use value in same step: (await (load-mcp "acme")) . Never write a #<…> form back into code.
Details: memory/recall "promises/waiting" or "promises/live", or by trigger.
